/target
# Cargo.lock is committed: amux is an application (a binary), so a pinned,
# reproducible dependency graph is checked in for outsider builds. (Library
# crates in the org still gitignore theirs.) Updating an org-crate dep now means
# `cargo update -p <crate>` + committing the refreshed Cargo.lock.

# Workflow worktrees and agent scratch — never part of the tree.
.claude/
